{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":12,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":1067,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1855186,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":277650,"Name":"MrsRoy","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277650.png?_r=1402827462","PhotoWidth":60,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1402715471,"LastPoster":{"Id":279229,"Name":"nadiakat17","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":57,"Preview":{"Id":1855186,"PostDate":1402715471,"PostContent":"Ladies my girlfriend forwarded this super interesting article regarding \"Unplugged Weddings\" bas...","Author":{"Signature":"Using Tapatalk","Email":"kiannabanana69@gmail.com","IpAddress":"200.106.87.106","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1397902614,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277650.png?_r=1402827462","PhotoWidth":60,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsRoy","Id":277650,"Name":"MrsRoy","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.229.253.28","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77290,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"57107dfdcf56a6bb001042c2cf01ffb4","RawContent":"\n\nLadies my girlfriend forwarded this super interesting article regarding \"Unplugged Weddings\" basically the do&#039;s and don&#039;ts regarding your guests taking pictures, ruining moments and shots or altering lighting with aggressive flashes.\n\n\nLink: &lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/m.huffpost.com\/us\/entry\/3331528\"&gt;http:\/\/m.huffpost.com\/us\/entry\/3331528&lt;\/a&gt;\n\n\nI&#039;m  to sure if it will be a direct link as I&#039;m posting from my phone, if not copy &amp;amp; paste to address bar (my apologies)\n\n\nAfter reading this article I will def be announcing  that we will be having an \"unplugged wedding\" \n\n\n\nThis is the announcement I saw in the article;\n\n\n\"Welcome, friends and family! Good evening, everyone. Please be seated. Dan and Jennifer invite you to be truly present at this special time. Please, turn off your cell phones and put down your cameras. The photographer will capture how this moment looks -- I encourage you all to capture how it feels with your hearts, without the distraction of technology\"\n\n\nI am totally in love with this idea. It helps me \"control\" what pictures are taken and I hate hate haaaate my pics being taken without knowing and then posted online. Huge pet peeve!\n\n\nAnyone else thinking of having an unplugged wedding ??","Attachments":[],"Id":1855186,"PostDate":1402715471,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br>\nLadies my girlfriend forwarded this super interesting article regarding \"Unplugged Weddings\" basically the do's and don'ts regarding your guests taking pictures, ruining moments and shots or altering lighting with aggressive flashes.<br><br>\nLink: <a href='http:\/\/m.huffpost.com\/us\/entry\/3331528' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/m.huffpost.com\/us\/entry\/3331528<\/a><br><br>\nI'm  to sure if it will be a direct link as I'm posting from my phone, if not copy & paste to address bar (my apologies)<br><br>\nAfter reading this article I will def be announcing  that we will be having an \"unplugged wedding\" <br><br><br>\nThis is the announcement I saw in the article;<br><br>\n\"Welcome, friends and family! Good evening, everyone. Please be seated. Dan and Jennifer invite you to be truly present at this special time. Please, turn off your cell phones and put down your cameras. The photographer will capture how this moment looks -- I encourage you all to capture how it feels with your hearts, without the distraction of technology\"<br><br>\nI am totally in love with this idea. It helps me \"control\" what pictures are taken and I hate hate haaaate my pics being taken without knowing and then posted online. Huge pet peeve!<br><br>\nAnyone else thinking of having an unplugged wedding ??\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Using Tapatalk","Email":"kiannabanana69@gmail.com","IpAddress":"200.106.87.106","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1397902614,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277650.png?_r=1402827462","PhotoWidth":60,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsRoy","Id":277650,"Name":"MrsRoy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.215.47.167","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77290,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"017046db9e782787bf9e66028cc2f999","RawContent":"We are. It drives me crazy when people are so worried about getting a good picture that they are not present in the moment. We also want to see peoples faces during our big moments and not their camera lens!","Attachments":[],"Id":1855264,"PostDate":1402779788,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are. It drives me crazy when people are so worried about getting a good picture that they are not present in the moment. We also want to see peoples faces during our big moments and not their camera lens!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lilkiwi22@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.107.239.59","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1368487523,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269552.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kirab22","Id":269552,"Name":"kirab22","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.222.215.154","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77290,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e8a4f8fc86668ec980ae6b7be39f7438","RawContent":"I really really want to do this as well. I don&#039;t mind when people take pictures with actual cameras from their seat, but I really hate seeing iPads and people who get up and move to get that &#039;perfect&#039; shot. Not sure if I can just ask people to stay seated and only take pics with cameras though so I&#039;m not sure what to do!","Attachments":[],"Id":1855267,"PostDate":1402786044,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I really really want to do this as well. I don't mind when people take pictures with actual cameras from their seat, but I really hate seeing iPads and people who get up and move to get that 'perfect' shot. Not sure if I can just ask people to stay seated and only take pics with cameras though so I'm not sure what to do! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"candle_23@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"66.222.215.154","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1375761701,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272291.jpg?_r=1388954341","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"candle23","Id":272291,"Name":"candle23","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.224.203.82","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77290,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by MrsRoy, 15 June 2014 - 04:37 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1402835875,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4b96f3c1ecc005821e281c5c18300e5c","RawContent":"The more I think about this idea the more and more I like it.\n\nI just really hope people will be respectful and follow instructions .... I already feel my brother giving me a hard time..\n\nBut id like all the pictures of my ceremony to be of my guests looking at my fianc\u00e9 and I taking our vows and not fumbling and getting distracted by their camera phones ....","Attachments":[],"Id":1855326,"PostDate":1402835854,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                The more I think about this idea the more and more I like it.<br>\nI just really hope people will be respectful and follow instructions .... I already feel my brother giving me a hard time..<br>\nBut id like all the pictures of my ceremony to be of my guests looking at my fianc\u00e9 and I taking our vows and not fumbling and getting distracted by their camera phones ....\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Using Tapatalk","Email":"kiannabanana69@gmail.com","IpAddress":"200.106.87.106","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1397902614,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277650.png?_r=1402827462","PhotoWidth":60,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsRoy","Id":277650,"Name":"MrsRoy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.117.76.99","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77290,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5c7982d714b5ec87804676c7d3953c75","RawContent":"I love this idea","Attachments":[],"Id":1855815,"PostDate":1403043053,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I love this idea \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"taryn_henderson@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"174.117.76.99","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1402952494,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"tarynh86","Id":278544,"Name":"tarynh86","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.193.91.193","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77290,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2cfade07294c724f07ed0001c042a4f9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;The more I think about it, the more I like this idea, especially for a wedding.&amp;nbsp; And these days everyone has an iPad to take pics, so you are competing with several of them.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1858515,"PostDate":1404776381,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>The more I think about it, the more I like this idea, especially for a wedding.\u00a0 And these days everyone has an iPad to take pics, so you are competing with several of them.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"boomer_396@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"67.193.91.193","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1404246953,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Brinley","Id":278775,"Name":"Brinley","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.165.85.61","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77290,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c53890a08d20d114e8d275d9bd67e001","RawContent":"totally love this idea!! thanks :) I kind of wanted people not taking pics for that exact reason posting before I see them..I hate pics of myself as it is...also I&#039;m paying good money for our photographer I woukdnt want my guests getting in his way of the good shots. ..and now I know how I can kindly ask them to not take pics....PLUS I love the point that they should just sit relax and enjoy not worry about capturing it on film.. \n\nsuppose I better run this by mom and my BP and see what they think lol.. I also don&#039;t want everyone pissed at me...I went to a wedding where they asked this and I was kind of offended and  I didn&#039;t get any pics but now I see why they asked no pics during ceremony","Attachments":[],"Id":1863545,"PostDate":1406783320,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                totally love this idea!! thanks <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I kind of wanted people not taking pics for that exact reason posting before I see them..I hate pics of myself as it is...also I'm paying good money for our photographer I woukdnt want my guests getting in his way of the good shots. ..and now I know how I can kindly ask them to not take pics....PLUS I love the point that they should just sit relax and enjoy not worry about capturing it on film.. <br>\nsuppose I better run this by mom and my BP and see what they think lol.. I also don't want everyone pissed at me...I went to a wedding where they asked this and I was kind of offended and  I didn't get any pics but now I see why they asked no pics during ceremony \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"crazycdngirl26@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"71.17.139.242","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1344502838,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258970.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":112,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MJTK","Id":258970,"Name":"MJTK","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.157.233.83","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77290,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"48336e501faeb78de8b4e3ea934828b5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;This is a great idea... there are only very few people I would trust posting a picture of me that I actually liked.. this is a good way to avoid pictures the bride does not approve.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1863548,"PostDate":1406783812,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>This is a great idea... there are only very few people I would trust posting a picture of me that I actually liked.. this is a good way to avoid pictures the bride does not approve.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">I'm lucky I'm in love with my best friend<\/span><\/em>","Email":"lily_1202@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.157.233.83","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406390649,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279175.jpg?_r=1406605860","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lilian84","Id":279175,"Name":"Lilian84","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.182.39.99","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77290,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f461e858ea16ba82f843138397690ec4","RawContent":"Great idea. I am not planning to have an \"unplugged wedding\" but we are asking that no pictures of the wedding day be posted until after the wedding.","Attachments":[],"Id":1863556,"PostDate":1406788995,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Great idea. I am not planning to have an \"unplugged wedding\" but we are asking that no pictures of the wedding day be posted until after the wedding. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Good Luck <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>","Email":"ms.tatiana.rivera@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.182.39.99","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403762681,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Tatimrivera","Id":278701,"Name":"Tatimrivera","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77290,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by calgarybride2015, 07 August 2014 - 08:27 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1407472076,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"88b3b391454ece4d200414450f486f78","RawContent":"I just asked this not knowing what an &#039;unplugged wedding&#039; is. while the more I think about it, I agree about people so focused on pictures and not the wedding, I also don&#039;t mind them getting their own pics. My huge thing is I want to be the FIRST to post pics on social media sites.   Considering having the MC announce this but have saw others on here post it in their pre travel letters. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1865146,"PostDate":1407472047,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I just asked this not knowing what an 'unplugged wedding' is. while the more I think about it, I agree about people so focused on pictures and not the wedding, I also don't mind them getting their own pics. My huge thing is I want to be the FIRST to post pics on social media sites.   Considering having the MC announce this but have saw others on here post it in their pre travel letters. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"77290","Title":"Unplugged Weddings","LastPostDate":1407934352},"Pages":{"TotalItems":12,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
