{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":10,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":1159,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1848460,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":277417,"Name":"immelsara","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1399394809,"LastPoster":{"Id":258970,"Name":"MJTK","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258970.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":112,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":57,"Preview":{"Id":1848460,"PostDate":1399394809,"PostContent":"What is everyones timeline? beach wedding at 4? then pictures? cocktail hour? dinner? pictures at...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"immel_sara@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"166.181.80.134","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1396278276,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"immelsara","Id":277417,"Name":"immelsara","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.111.218.208","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77002,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d3863605c6414e1d4c7d3d7478d71705","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;What is everyones timeline? beach wedding at 4? then pictures? cocktail hour? dinner? pictures at sunset? beach party? I would love to hear ideas and what other options would be.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1848460,"PostDate":1399394809,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>What is everyones timeline? beach wedding at 4? then pictures? cocktail hour? dinner? pictures at sunset? beach party? I would love to hear ideas and what other options would be.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"immel_sara@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"166.181.80.134","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1396278276,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"immelsara","Id":277417,"Name":"immelsara","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.246.139.68","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77002,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d77d7e5992fcbb588cf07724760b46e7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;This is the timeline my photographer sent me for my wedding that starts at 4 just so you have an idea. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This is for 6 hour of photography but my reception ends at 10 pm.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(33,33,33);\"&gt;3:00 PM - 4:00 PM | Getting Ready&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(33,33,33);\"&gt;4:00 PM - 4:30 PM | Ceremony&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(33,33,33);\"&gt;4:30 PM - 5:30 PM | Cocktails + Sunset Portraits&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(33,33,33);\"&gt;5:30 PM - 7:30 PM | Dinner + Toasts&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(33,33,33);\"&gt;7:30 PM - 9:00 PM | Dancing + Reception Fun&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1848462,"PostDate":1399395158,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>This is the timeline my photographer sent me for my wedding that starts at 4 just so you have an idea. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is for 6 hour of photography but my reception ends at 10 pm.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(33,33,33)\">3:00 PM - 4:00 PM | Getting Ready<\/span><br><span  style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(33,33,33)\">4:00 PM - 4:30 PM | Ceremony<\/span><br><span  style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(33,33,33)\">4:30 PM - 5:30 PM | Cocktails + Sunset Portraits<\/span><br><span  style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(33,33,33)\">5:30 PM - 7:30 PM | Dinner + Toasts<\/span><br><span  style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(33,33,33)\">7:30 PM - 9:00 PM | Dancing + Reception Fun<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\n<p>43 guests plus bride and groom.... <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Engagement Photos - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630<\/a>","Email":"sandyycaza@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"66.246.139.68","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1357674861,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264077.jpg?_r=1415048239","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NJBride2014","Id":264077,"Name":"NJBride2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77002,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9374712b1bdc53153c6e1090fb261fa4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I will be going over about an hour and would have to pay the photographer for an extra hour :(&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;1:00 - 2:00 Getting Ready&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;2:00 - 2:30 Ceremony&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;3:30 - 4:30 Cocktail Hour\/Pictures&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;5:00 - 8:00 Dinner\/Reception on La Barcaza Wedding Boat.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I don&#039;t know what happens after this. I may end up either extending the boat or everyone go to the disco at the hotel. (Not sure if there is even a disco there). I guess I should check that out.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1848471,"PostDate":1399398209,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I will be going over about an hour and would have to pay the photographer for an extra hour <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>1:00 - 2:00 Getting Ready<\/p>\n<p>2:00 - 2:30 Ceremony<\/p>\n<p>3:30 - 4:30 Cocktail Hour\/Pictures<\/p>\n<p>5:00 - 8:00 Dinner\/Reception on La Barcaza Wedding Boat.<\/p>\n<p>I don't know what happens after this. I may end up either extending the boat or everyone go to the disco at the hotel. (Not sure if there is even a disco there). I guess I should check that out.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Kristy and Nathan<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Melia Caribe Tropical <\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>April 17, 2015<\/strong>","Email":"colek_64@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395346614,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277264.jpg?_r=1429937323","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kcole123","Id":277264,"Name":"kcole123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"12.94.125.70","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77002,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"97087e7d9e99a9f0f476dda27d01d6c0","RawContent":"Thanks for starting this thread! My ceremony will be at 4 which is kind of early for me!\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1848479,"PostDate":1399401179,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for starting this thread! My ceremony will be at 4 which is kind of early for me!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"malyna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.235.105.205","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397440022,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277580.jpg?_r=1397779480","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"malyna","Id":277580,"Name":"malyna","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.226.112.144","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77002,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f118f374f430c55716ac8707d5f6ec66","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;This is my timeline for now - still toying with it.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My ceremony is early at 2pm, but it&#039;s in December so I&#039;m okay with that (sunset at 5:10pm). It also gives us a ton of time for pics which is important to us. We&#039;re also planning on paying to extend our reception for 3 more hours than what is included :). We hired our photographer for 8-10 hours, and our videographer will be there for 8 hours probably&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;9:00 AM\u2013 12:45 PM   | Hair and Makeup. Bridesmaids should be dressed by 12:45pm&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;1 PM \u2013 1:45 PM\t\t | Both sides getting Ready \/ Putting on Bride\u2019s dress shots\n\n2:00 PM \u2013 2:30 PM  &amp;nbsp; | Ceremony\n\n2:30 PM \u2013 5:30 PM  &amp;nbsp; | Pictures w\/ family, guests, wedding party, bride and groom pics, food and break somewhere in there&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\u20285:00 PM \u2013 6:00 PM  &amp;nbsp; | Cocktails\n\n6:00 PM \u2013 11:00 PM&amp;nbsp; | Dinner, Dancing + Reception Fun\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We put a break in between the ceremony and reception. We figured we&#039;re all staying at the resort, so people can go take a nap, change, eat, do whatever they want in between. We don&#039;t want our reception to finish too early&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1848483,"PostDate":1399402085,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>This is my timeline for now - still toying with it.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My ceremony is early at 2pm, but it's in December so I'm okay with that (sunset at 5:10pm). It also gives us a ton of time for pics which is important to us. We're also planning on paying to extend our reception for 3 more hours than what is included <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>. We hired our photographer for 8-10 hours, and our videographer will be there for 8 hours probably<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>9:00 AM\u2013 12:45 PM\u00a0\u00a0 | Hair and Makeup. Bridesmaids should be dressed by 12:45pm<\/p>\n<p>1 PM \u2013 1:45 PM\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 | Both sides getting Ready \/ Putting on Bride\u2019s dress shots<br>\n2:00 PM \u2013 2:30 PM\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 | Ceremony<br>\n2:30 PM \u2013 5:30 PM\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 | Pictures w\/ family, guests, wedding party, bride and groom pics, food and break somewhere in there<\/p>\n<p>\u20285:00 PM \u2013 6:00 PM\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 | Cocktails<br>\n6:00 PM \u2013 11:00 PM\u00a0 | Dinner, Dancing + Reception Fun<br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We put a break in between the ceremony and reception. We figured we're all staying at the resort, so people can go take a nap, change, eat, do whatever they want in between. We don't want our reception to finish too early<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married December 19, 2014 at Beach Palace Resort in Cancun, Mexico<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Wedding Review<\/p>\n<p>Part 1 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 2 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 3 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"lilyluu83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395609348,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277296.jpg?_r=1421643766","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tygrrlily","Id":277296,"Name":"tygrrlily","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.62.217.165","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77002,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6f106726b1f15790b0b1d430e60ce649","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;So far we have&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;12-2:30 Bridal Spa Shower&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;2:30-4:30 Hair, Makeup Getting ready&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;4:45-5- Wedding party photos (bride w\/ father- groom w\/parents etc)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;5:00 ceremony&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;5:30 Sunset portraits&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;6:00 cocktail hour &amp;amp; reception&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1848515,"PostDate":1399414364,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>So far we have<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>12-2:30 Bridal Spa Shower<\/p>\n<p>2:30-4:30 Hair, Makeup Getting ready<\/p>\n<p>4:45-5- Wedding party photos (bride w\/ father- groom w\/parents etc)<\/p>\n<p>5:00 ceremony<\/p>\n<p>5:30 Sunset portraits<\/p>\n<p>6:00 cocktail hour & reception<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amanda.hodges1@snhu.edu","IpAddress":"24.62.217.165","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1398538337,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277733.jpg?_r=1400873765","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":213,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BusyBee280","Id":277733,"Name":"BusyBee280","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.118.82.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77002,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"17da2a1ea84ec8e5411df6a9d0478827","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Good to see what everyone else is doing. I haven&#039;t even thought about my timeline&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1850750,"PostDate":1400283755,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Good to see what everyone else is doing. I haven't even thought about my timeline<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"latanyabryant@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.37.216.36","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1391310804,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276443.jpg?_r=1391315507","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tanya81","Id":276443,"Name":"Tanya81","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.63.242.236","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77002,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ef7e4907a03319e81033ad13bd890cfa","RawContent":"Thanks for all the info as I am working on our wedding timeline now.","Attachments":[],"Id":1851014,"PostDate":1400423244,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for all the info as I am working on our wedding timeline now. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"olivia_colt.murski@outlook.com","IpAddress":"68.63.242.236","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1392688576,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276756.jpg?_r=1399903658","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"colivia","Id":276756,"Name":"colivia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77002,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3dfffa5a8cfe43c7d5b86d63ca0d3a08","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I have my basic wedding time line, but haven&#039;t discussed anything about time with the photographers, spa, etc.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;3:30pm ceremony&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;4:00pm toast and appetizers, group photos&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;4:30pm ish - 5:30pm photo shoot with wedding party and then bride &amp;amp; groom, while there is open bar for everyone else&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;5:30pm-11:00pm - dinner and reception&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;11:00pm DISCO!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1862662,"PostDate":1406497202,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I have my basic wedding time line, but haven't discussed anything about time with the photographers, spa, etc.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>3:30pm ceremony<\/p>\n<p>4:00pm toast and appetizers, group photos<\/p>\n<p>4:30pm ish - 5:30pm photo shoot with wedding party and then bride & groom, while there is open bar for everyone else<\/p>\n<p>5:30pm-11:00pm - dinner and reception<\/p>\n<p>11:00pm DISCO!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.165.85.61","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77002,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8bfa4e7c1a2150d0b30c9e8a7f2afff4","RawContent":"I wasn&#039;t sure what to expect but tbh my photographer actually helped me decide time line lol...\n\nhere&#039;s the basics\n\nwedding 2pm\n\npics following\n\nsupper 6-8\n\ndance on beach 8:30-11:30\n\nthen hit up the 24 hr restaurant and either call it a night or go to the disco..not sure yet..","Attachments":[],"Id":1863538,"PostDate":1406782163,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I wasn't sure what to expect but tbh my photographer actually helped me decide time line lol...<br>\nhere's the basics<br>\nwedding 2pm<br>\npics following<br>\nsupper 6-8<br>\ndance on beach 8:30-11:30<br>\nthen hit up the 24 hr restaurant and either call it a night or go to the disco..not sure yet..\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"crazycdngirl26@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"71.17.139.242","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1344502838,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258970.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":112,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MJTK","Id":258970,"Name":"MJTK","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"77002","Title":"Wedding Day Timeline","LastPostDate":1406782163},"Pages":{"TotalItems":10,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
